  "solution": {
    "text": "<ol><li> A - Follows R-scheme to give para-nitrophenol.</li></ol><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/aa960b28-94e0-4ea5-b0c0-0bc3629a167d-image.png\"/><br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/227e7b43-3e08-4942-bc95-079ba65d85df-image.png\"/></p><p>    2. resorcinol is converted to 4-nitrobenzene-1,3-diol  by Following S-scheme</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/514a7883-03f1-4368-afe2-4b98b0ff6182-image.png\"/></p><ul><li>      Nitro benzene is 2-nitro-aniline. by Following Q-scheme<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/88faaa50-cf32-4344-ba38-6d932e787df0-image.png\"/></li></ul><p> </p><ul><li>para-nitro toluene is converted to 4-nitro-benzamide  by Following P-scheme</li></ul><p><br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/23a1f665-de4b-4baf-92d5-3672c7f3a808-image.png\"/></p>",
